{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念三寶六師佛菩薩念梵釋四王金剛天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人各整衣䠒跪合掌聞舉弟子某甲等處隨言後說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說　念無盡三寶願降臨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說　念供養無盡諸三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念普賢菩薩懺悔師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說\n　念誓受如来三歸依戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念歸命無盡佛法僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說　念戒清涼菩薩摩訶薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說　念遠離一切諸性相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說　念皆共速成無上覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "志仙"}
